msgid "<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Відсутній перегляд Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong>.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p><p>Модуль встановлює три конфігурації переглядів у папці /config/"
"install. Усі вони мають бути встановлені, щоб панель могла показувати "
"результати.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p><p>Щоб виправити: скопіюйте вміст <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> у імпорт типу «View» за адресою "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. Якщо ви синхронізуєте "
"конфігурацію з файловою системою, додайте ці перегляди до репозиторію.</p>"

